   },
   "Label": {
    "text": "A low sun casting long shadows through four cascades; a spot light from above, large enough that its shadows soften away from what casts them; a point light bobbing between pillars, shadowing every way; a light through a window, its cookie; a lantern's bars all round it. Spheres float above the floor, a box spins, and a fence casts thin shadows."
   }
